================================================================================

## Layout Detection
- [ ] Detect parent display property (flex, grid, block)
- [ ] Extract relevant flex properties from parent
- [ ] Extract relevant grid properties from parent
- [ ] Determine if wrapper is needed for layout preservation

## Wrapper Generation
- [ ] Generate minimal wrapper div with layout styles
- [ ] Only include necessary layout properties
- [ ] Avoid over-wrapping (single elements don't need flex wrapper)

